Package: bitget-private-terminal
Version: 3.1.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: default-jre (>= 2:1.11) | java11-runtime, libsecret-tools, fonts-dejavu-core
Maintainer: Bitget Private Futures Terminal Contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>
Description: Read-only Java desktop dashboard for Bitget futures
 Displays public futures prices and, with user-supplied credentials,
 read-only account equity and open-position data. Includes a responsive,
 borderless always-on-top window and GNOME Keyring credential storage.
